LLM APIs & Prompt Engineering
3–4 weeks
Learn to call LLM APIs (Anthropic Claude, OpenAI GPT-4o, Google Gemini). Master prompt engineering: system prompts, few-shot examples, chain-of-thought, structured outputs (JSON mode), and temperature/top-p controls. Understand token economics and prompt caching.

