Next: RAG — Retrieval-Augmented Generation

2
RAG — Retrieval-Augmented Generation
5–7 weeks
Build RAG systems that ground LLMs in your data. Learn text chunking strategies, embedding models, vector databases (Pinecone, Weaviate, pgvector, Qdrant), and retrieval pipelines. Implement hybrid search and reranking. Evaluate retrieval quality with recall@k and faithfulness metrics.

